# 2. BUSINESS MODEL

CampusEats is initially a food-ordering service specifically focused on **TUBATSI shop**.

There must NOT be multiple restaurant/vendor options in the customer-facing homepage.

The only vendor/shop currently available is:

**TUBATSI**

Do not add Uber Eats-style restaurant browsing or multiple vendors.

The customer browses the TUBATSI menu, adds food to the cart and proceeds to checkout.

The order does NOT get sent electronically to TUBATSI.

Instead:

CUSTOMER
→ CAMPUS EATS WEBSITE
→ CAMPUS EATS BACKEND
→ STAFF NOTIFICATION
→ STAFF MEMBER ACCEPTS ORDER
→ STAFF MEMBER PHYSICALLY WALKS TO TUBATSI
→ STAFF MEMBER PLACES THE ORDER AT TUBATSI
→ STAFF MEMBER COLLECTS FOOD
→ STAFF MEMBER DELIVERS TO CUSTOMER

This is the core business workflow.

