# 9. SMS NOTIFICATIONS TO STAFF

When a new order is successfully placed, send an SMS notification to the configured staff phone numbers.

The system must support MULTIPLE staff phone numbers.

Example configuration:

STAFF_PHONE_NUMBERS=

Each configured staff phone number should receive the new-order SMS.

This means:

STAFF MEMBER A
STAFF MEMBER B
STAFF MEMBER C
STAFF MEMBER D

can all receive the notification.

The staff member who is currently on duty can then open the staff dashboard and accept the order.

IMPORTANT:

The SMS should not need to contain every possible piece of data.

Keep the SMS concise.

Example:

> CAMPUS EATS — NEW ORDER #10482
> Customer: Thabiso Mokoena
> Shop: TUBATSI
> Items: 2x Chicken Burger, 1x Chips, 1x Coke
> Location: Wits Main Campus
> Note: Outside library entrance
> Total: R245.97
> Open CampusEats staff dashboard to accept.

If a customer photo is attached, the SMS should say:

> Photo available in staff dashboard.

Do not attempt to send the actual image through ordinary SMS.

