# 24. STAFF PHYSICAL ORDER PROCESS

This is important.

The CampusEats website does NOT send the order to TUBATSI electronically.

Once staff accepts the order:

1. Staff receives/opens order.
2. Staff sees TUBATSI as the shop.
3. Staff walks to TUBATSI.
4. Staff physically places the food order at TUBATSI.
5. Staff waits for/collects the food.
6. Staff delivers the food to the customer.

The system should therefore allow staff to update the order status.

