# 41. CONCURRENCY PROTECTION

This is critical.

Two staff members may receive the same SMS.

Both may attempt to accept the same order.

The backend must guarantee:

# ONE ORDER

ONE STAFF ASSIGNMENT

Use database transactions, atomic update, locking, or another reliable server-side mechanism.

Never rely solely on frontend checks.

