# 42. FIVE-MINUTE TIMER IMPLEMENTATION

Do NOT rely exclusively on:

setTimeout()

in the browser.

The server must determine whether five minutes have elapsed.

Use:

created_at

and:

acceptance_deadline

or equivalent server-side timestamps.

When a pending order is requested or processed, verify whether it has expired.

Ideally also use a background scheduled job/worker to automatically transition expired pending orders to CANCELLED.

